# Local Claude Code state (settings.local.json is kept deliberately - it holds
# the pre-approved commands and the GitHub sync hooks - and so is the sync
# script those hooks run)
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.local.json
!.claude/hooks/

# Raw instrument data stays on the computer that collected it: GitHub refuses
# a file over 100 MB and a repository slows long before that. These formats are
# never part of a paper - cryo-EM movies (EER, DM4), particle stacks (MRCS) and
# tilt series (ST, ALI). The project sync also keeps any new file of 50 MB or
# more off GitHub and says so, so a format missing here is still caught.
*.eer
*.dm4
*.mrcs
*.st
*.ali
